# The cloud workers need cloud/ and nothing else. Without this the build context is
# the whole monorepo — ~150MB of NFL play-by-play parquet, a 45MB RacingEngine seed
# and the Next.js site — none of which any worker uses.
#
# All three lines are required. "*" excludes the cloud directory itself, "!cloud"
# puts the directory back, and "!cloud/**" puts its CONTENTS back. Without the
# third line COPY cloud/requirements.txt finds nothing and the build fails.
*
!cloud
!cloud/**

# Never ship secrets into an image, even by accident.
cloud/.env
cloud/.env.*
!cloud/.env.example
